          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "वार्ताहर (vārtāhar) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit vārttāhara, 'a carrier of tidings, a messenger' (Monier-Williams)."
