              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने प्रकाशित केलं, tyāne prakāśit kelaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is published agrees; प्रकाशित होणे, to be published."
            }
          ]
        },
